	| Product Field and Value | version                  | 7 |
	| Quantity                | 2                        |   |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |   |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |   |
	And I generate the product purchase ID value for the product purchase made by "Korlic - ${staticProjectName}" for "DXP Production"
